+# ECLIPSE R8 — VeilLink native theme integration gates
+
+1. Use the source-accurate 4-target Swift patch in the owner-delivered R8 ZIP (SHA in MANIFEST); this GitHub Inbox diff is only a review gate document.
+2. ECLIPSE cards use existing .veilCard() and VeilTheme. Never introduce separate skin controls.
+3. React to VeilAppearanceController.selection and colorMode.
+4. Test Veil Original, Apple Soft, Instrument, Islet and gated Plainline.
+5. Instrument Dark must match actual App metal plates and orange indicator accents.
+6. No chess-board hint overlays on live Gomoku games.
+7. Show only genuinely measured coordinate-free depth/nodes after R5 telemetry integration.
+8. Only postgame show verified actual committed move replay in a read-only board.
+9. Keep all other games' Grok bot unchanged, preserve the GomokuBoardView input hitboxes.
+10. Preserve old learning files, DB, history and game rules.
+11. Resolve overlaps with #197/#198 and search/control proposals before applying changes.
+12. Require full-main git apply --check, iOS Xcode compilation, XCTest and real-device visual QA.
+13. Release/IPA, version numbers, third-party rights and legacy JS retirement are separate governed operations.
+14. Do not self-merge this proposal.
